<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Ford said cut by DLJ.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Ford said cut by DLJ.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities on Tuesday cut Ford Motor Co from its recommended buy list, downgrading the stock to market perform, according to a source at the firm.</p>
<p>-- Ford shares closed at 38-1/4 on Monday on the New York Stock Exchange.  </p>
<p>-- DLJ analyst Wendy Needham was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
